"invocation of the IRQ handler function. If your program needs to save one of"
" these values to access after the IRQ handler has returned (e.g. by saving "
"it in a class instance or global variable), then it needs to take a copy of "
"the data, either by using ``bytes()`` or ``bluetooth.UUID()``, like this::"
msgstr ""
